      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: showing_the_kids_you_can_do_it_too; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts Prince Harry kneeling and interacting with a young child in what appears to be a community or charity event, surrounded by adults. The overlaid text reads \"showing the kids you can do it too,\" which is intended to convey encouragement and empowerment. There is no visible toxicity, hate, or harmful content in the image itself. The scene is positive and motivational, aiming to inspire children to believe in their own abilities. The meme does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful elements as defined in the provided knowledge base. The intent is to promote positivity, self-confidence, and inclusivity, without targeting any specific group or community with harmful messages.",
