      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Prince_Harry",
      "label": "Prince Harry of the United Kingdom",
      "description": "Prince Harry, Duke of Sussex, is a member of the British royal family. His public appearances, especially those involving children and charitable causes, are often framed as inspirational or motivational. The meme leverages his public persona as a figure of encouragement and accessibility to convey its message. His identity as a royal figure adds context to the scene, implying a symbolic gesture of empowerment from someone of high status.",
