      "label": "encouraging emotion",
      "description": "Prince Harry is kneeling and smiling warmly while reaching out to the child, conveying a supportive and uplifting emotional state. His body language and facial expression suggest he is motivating the child to believe in their ability to succeed.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
