      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Prince Harry is mapped as 'showing the kids'",
      "description": "The top text 'showing the kids' is mapped onto Prince Harry, who is visually depicted kneeling and interacting with a child. The text implies that Prince Harry is demonstrating something to children, and his visual posture and expression (smiling, reaching out) are interpreted as embodying this role. The mapping is based on the textual instruction being visually instantiated by Prince Harry's action and presence in the scene.",
