      "label": "User projected onto the motivational message and scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual message 'showing the kids you can do it too' and the scene of Prince Harry encouraging a child, interpreting the meme as a personal call to action or identification with the empowering message. The phrase 'you can do it too' directly addresses the viewer, creating a sense of personal relevance and encouragement.",
